Logger System

🎯 Goal: Design a Logger System that allows applications to log messages at different severity levels in a
         thread-safe and configurable manner.

Functional Requirements:
The system should support multiple log levels:
DEBUG
INFO
WARN
ERROR

A log message should be logged only if its level is equal to or higher than the configured log level.

The system should support logging messages in the format:
[TIMESTAMP] [LEVEL] [MESSAGE]

The system should allow:
Setting the global log level
Changing the log level at runtime

The logger should support multiple outputs (appenders):
Console
File
(Optional) In-memory / custom sink

The system should be thread-safe:
Multiple threads can log simultaneously
Log messages should not interleave or corrupt output